# 009 - integer overflow on + is a Value error (§4), never a wrap and never a
# panic. Line 1 is already in Output.lines when it happens and line 3 never
# runs: §3 requires the output of the lines before the failure, then the error.
--- source
print 1;
print 9223372036854775807 + 1;
print 2;
--- expect
1
error: Value at line 2: integer overflow
